{{also|sméar}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|smeren}}, {{m|enm|smerien}}, from {{inh|en|ang|smerian}}, {{m|ang|smyrian}}, {{m|ang|smierwan||to anoint or rub with grease, oil, etc.}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*smirwijan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*smirwijaną}}. {{doublet|en|schmear}}.

Cognate with {{cog|stq|smeere}}, {{cog|nl|smeren}}, {{cog|nds|smeren}}, {{cog|de|schmieren}}.

