#* {{quote-text|en|year=1985|author=w:Don DeLillo|title={{w|White Noise (novel)|White Noise}}|publisher=Penguin|section=Part 3, Chapter 39, p. 311|url=https://archive.org/details/whitenoise00deli/page/311/mode/1up?q=smear
